perform: {
fn: import { sendEmail } from "@src/server/jobs/emailSender.js"
},
// Grant access to necessary entities
entities: [User, EmailQueue]
}
```
- Jobs can be scheduled or triggered programmatically from Wasp actions or other jobs.

